    <string name="local_later_title">Want a server later?</string>
    <string name="local_later">A server is just a computer that is always on: an old laptop with Linux and Docker, a Raspberry Pi or a NAS. Install MarkMySteps on it, make an account there and sign in to it in this app.</string>
